*/*                                                                  */ 01750000
*/*   PURPOSE - THIS ENTRY POINT IS ENTERED WHENEVER A               */ 01800000
*/*             MODULE WITHIN DSF REQUESTS THAT A RESOURCE           */ 01850000
*/*             ACCESS CONTROL FACILITY(RACF) VOLUME LEVEL OR        */ 01900000
