*/*                 DATASET TYPE CODES ARE :                         */ 02810000
*/*                      1 = VSAM DATASET                            */ 02820000
*/*                      2 = PASSWORD PROTECTED DATASET              */ 02830000
*/*                      3 = UNEXPIRED DATASET                       */ 02840000
*/*                                                                  */ 02850000
*/*                 DSF COMMAND CODES ARE :                          */ 02900000
*/*                      1 = COMMAND IS BUILDX                       */ 02950000
*/*                      2 = COMMAND IS INIT                         */ 03000000
*/*                      3 = COMMAND IS INSPECT                      */ 03050000
*/*                      4 = COMMAND IS REFORMAT                     */ 03100000
*/*                                                                  */ 03850000
*/*   OUTPUT  - NONE                                                 */ 03900000
*/*                                                                  */ 03950000
*/*   EXIT NORMAL - A RETURN TO THE CALLER WITH ONE OF THE           */ 04000000
*/*                 FOLLOWING RETURN CODES:                          */ 04050000
*/*                                                                  */ 04100000
*/*           DEC HEX                                                */ 04150000
*/*           --- ---                                                */ 04200000
*/*            00 (00) BYAPSS CHECKING FOR THIS VOLUME ,             */ 04250000
*/*                    DO NOT RETURN TO ICKUSER1 FOR THIS VOLUME     */ 04300000
*/*                                                                  */ 04350000
*/*            04 (04) BYPASS CHECKING FOR THIS DATASET ,            */ 04400000
*/*                    BUT RETURN TO ICKUSER1 FOR NEXT DATASET       */ 04450000
*/*                                                                  */ 04500000
*/*            08 (08) DO NORMAL CHECKING FOR THIS DATASET ,         */ 04501500
*/*                    BUT RETURN TO ICKUSER1 FOR NEXT DATASET       */ 04503000
*/*                                                                  */ 04504500
*/*            12 (0C) DO NORMAL CHECKING FOR THIS VOLUME ,          */ 04506000
*/*                    DO NOT RETURN TO ICKUSER1 FOR THIS VOLUME     */ 04507500
*/*                                                                  */ 04509000
*/*            16 (10) REJECT THIS DATASET ,                         */ 04510500
*/*                    BUT RETURN TO ICKUSER1 FOR NEXT DATASET       */ 04512000
*/*                                                                  */ 04513500
*/*            20 (14) TERMINATE THIS COMMAND                        */ 04515000
*/*                                                                  */ 04516500
