*/*            THE ONLY ALLOWABLE RETURN CODES ARE 0, 12 AND 20.     */ 04519500
*/*            (I.E. ALLOW DSF USER TO PROCESS VOLUME FOR GIVEN      */ 04521000
*/*             DATASET TYPE, DO NOT ALLOW DSF USER TO PROCESS       */ 04522500
